sequenceDiagram
    participant Action as Download/Document Action
    participant Driver as DownloadTrackedDriver
    participant Browser as Browser Node
    participant Selenium as Selenium Managed Downloads
    participant Result as Test Result Model
    participant DB as Persistence
    participant User
    participant API as Artifact API

    Action->>Browser: Trigger download
    Browser->>Selenium: Register downloadable files for session
    Action->>Driver: Collect downloaded files
    Driver->>Selenium: Poll managed downloads
    Selenium-->>Driver: Stable downloadable file metadata/content
    Driver->>Selenium: Delete downloadable files after capture
    Driver-->>Action: Downloaded artifacts
    Action->>Result: Attach artifact/result data
    Result->>DB: Persist result and artifact references
    User->>API: Request artifact or screenshot
    API->>DB: Find artifact in result path
    DB-->>API: Artifact file
    API-->>User: Binary response
